  "title": "Change the Menu Screen Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "メニュー画面の背景を変更【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "3c7838a147963a056d8e6d179c320e243090050f396803be89a5da4bb3a0ae15",
      "translation": "Change the Menu Screen Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "3c7838a147963a056d8e6d179c320e243090050f396803be89a5da4bb3a0ae15"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "メニュー画面の背景を変更します。",
      "sourceHash": "2804d8108800d7c54cef94f0300a035be595051a19706bf5e7bc9be65c8ec7a8",
      "translation": "Changes the menu screen background.",
      "contextHash": "2804d8108800d7c54cef94f0300a035be595051a19706bf5e7bc9be65c8ec7a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景をスクロールさせたり、スイッチで背景を切り替える設定も可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "19a3779a6044c60a5eb4fdde015c8b151c37b2c9b26b2fe37798986b9c1e9811",
      "translation": "You can also set the background to scroll or switch backgrounds using switches.",
      "contextHash": "19a3779a6044c60a5eb4fdde015c8b151c37b2c9b26b2fe37798986b9c1e9811"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実際にはメニューだけでなく、オプション、セーブ／ロード、ゲーム終了、店、名前入力の各シーンも対象となることにご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "8f2f5ef8babbe2530cd2625eea517ba6d8ab094120f8081364bc9d37d52cf9cf",
      "translation": "Please note that this applies not only to the menu, but also to the Options, Save/Load, Game End, Shop, and Name Input scenes.",
      "contextHash": "8f2f5ef8babbe2530cd2625eea517ba6d8ab094120f8081364bc9d37d52cf9cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "（厳密には、Scene_MenuBaseを継承したシーン）",
      "sourceHash": "f9927606de24dbe8b2d81b23da1102aea4eb9a57b8fa70385684d191a08037a5",
      "translation": "(Strictly speaking, scenes that inherit from Scene_MenuBase)",
      "contextHash": "f9927606de24dbe8b2d81b23da1102aea4eb9a57b8fa70385684d191a08037a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各シーン毎に背景を変更することも可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "c3cfa2adadf05b547bb4a09f5e2258c55cdf2e944d4ebe1c653cf19db2506a10",
      "translation": "You can also change the background for each scene.",
      "contextHash": "c3cfa2adadf05b547bb4a09f5e2258c55cdf2e944d4ebe1c653cf19db2506a10"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the function ON from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
