      "contextHash": "b18a52f2eb77424c53401c869d9d0794f50cf78fcac0419925dd44d5549a05bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータの共通設定に背景画像を設定すると、対象の全シーンに背景が表示されるようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "ec5dfc46771084a043ec380e64a43b7698fe49d7827b2c2d16af1b48a8650106",
      "translation": "Set a background image in the common settings of the plugin parameters, and the background will be displayed in all applicable scenes.",
      "contextHash": "ec5dfc46771084a043ec380e64a43b7698fe49d7827b2c2d16af1b48a8650106"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各シーン毎に設定を変更したい場合は『背景リスト』を選択して、詳細設定をしてください。初期状態で主なシーンはあらかじめ設定しているので、お好みで設定を変更してください。",
      "sourceHash": "0c311d93b55b86844c1bd183aea6e5ce2328a56aa671f3208212edce97f00702",
      "translation": "To change the settings for each scene, select “Background List” and configure the details. The main scenes are configured in advance by default, so change the settings as you like.",
      "contextHash": "0c311d93b55b86844c1bd183aea6e5ce2328a56aa671f3208212edce97f00702"
    },
