      "translation": "Scene_Shop: Shop screen",
      "contextHash": "60dcb7dcc99e2b6b85b3f1e6921ad943e9bdb025fe3a41dc7e2d552fd11b398e"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-012",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "Scene_Name : 名前入力画面",
      "sourceHash": "c7f57d4a4476d787cfbbb85f5e483e94680a21bec2a0d87190a3c8bf9124a718",
      "translation": "Scene_Name: Name Input screen",
      "contextHash": "c7f57d4a4476d787cfbbb85f5e483e94680a21bec2a0d87190a3c8bf9124a718"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記にはない外部プラグインで追加したシーン（Scene_MenuBaseを継承）も、対応するシーン名を手入力すれば変更されるはずです。",
      "sourceHash": "5b11e2a5960d14328b90c9d06bcf79558dc9933a6aa9e982aaf92da862e76061",
      "translation": "Scenes added by external plugins not listed above (inheriting from Scene_MenuBase) should also be changed if you manually enter the corresponding scene name.",
      "contextHash": "5b11e2a5960d14328b90c9d06bcf79558dc9933a6aa9e982aaf92da862e76061"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "「Scene_」の文字列でプラグイン内を検索してみるとよさげです。",
      "sourceHash": "b7030b1f9dd9b0da2efdb720d2c2e02d596deb3c7e0c315392483e92d748ef04",
      "translation": "Searching the plugin for the string “Scene_” should help.",
      "contextHash": "b7030b1f9dd9b0da2efdb720d2c2e02d596deb3c7e0c315392483e92d748ef04"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "背景の変更（Change Background）",
      "sourceHash": "df7a6fa622c8cc2d2ffe683a6163bd3669d29356778c1dfedf79862fd91b4829",
      "translation": "Changing the Background (Change Background)",
      "contextHash": "df7a6fa622c8cc2d2ffe683a6163bd3669d29356778c1dfedf79862fd91b4829"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当プラグインではスイッチを条件にして、各シーンの背景を変更できます。",
      "sourceHash": "681a277358e1bcf603a4fdad385d3ab3f5b6f0dee7579c46f01fd04fad4a885e",
      "translation": "This plugin allows you to change the background of each scene based on switches.",
      "contextHash": "681a277358e1bcf603a4fdad385d3ab3f5b6f0dee7579c46f01fd04fad4a885e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "シーンを『ALL』に設定し、スイッチを条件に設定すれば、条件次第で背景が変化するようにできます。",
      "sourceHash": "2d74632129177f2169f4340f3e8ee2a62a737eb3de5d6d6bcd5641abbfc57272",
      "translation": "By setting the scene to “ALL” and specifying a switch as a condition, you can make the background change depending on the conditions.",
      "contextHash": "2d74632129177f2169f4340f3e8ee2a62a737eb3de5d6d6bcd5641abbfc57272"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、物語の進行や現在地、時間帯に応じて背景を変化させることができます。",
      "sourceHash": "540c9411e1a294ac86cf7aff81fcb43a63513edc0d27ffb386f571017481bfb3",
      "translation": "For example, you can change the background according to story progression, current location, or time of day.",
      "contextHash": "540c9411e1a294ac86cf7aff81fcb43a63513edc0d27ffb386f571017481bfb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、オプションやセーブ／ロード画面については通常、タイトルから呼び出した場合とメニューから呼び出した場合は区別されません。",
      "sourceHash": "87e767aeaa58cb455d0bf61b427614460858b7b80f05ee2a6f5fad634ec97fe0",
      "translation": "Normally, the Options and Save/Load screens are not distinguished when called from the title screen or from the menu.",
      "contextHash": "87e767aeaa58cb455d0bf61b427614460858b7b80f05ee2a6f5fad634ec97fe0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ゲーム中は常にオンとなるスイッチを用意することで、区別する方法があります。",
      "sourceHash": "b38c370f60f07063404d3cb09100caf69dcd6c77670018a651f999873d0d9f91",
      "translation": "You can distinguish them by preparing a switch that is always ON during gameplay.",
      "contextHash": "b38c370f60f07063404d3cb09100caf69dcd6c77670018a651f999873d0d9f91"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "背景リスト（BackgroundList）",
      "sourceHash": "1a09f005dc37d4c8d0c5d0d0398d000a3c6f3b6cd55a679968ee7e684dd40738",
      "translation": "Background List (BackgroundList)",
      "contextHash": "1a09f005dc37d4c8d0c5d0d0398d000a3c6f3b6cd55a679968ee7e684dd40738"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "シーン毎の背景画像を管理するリストです。",
      "sourceHash": "e4a7c8d42afd64bf1120c0678dc42a218526016d521acff05459049194451009",
      "translation": "This is a list for managing the background image for each scene.",
      "contextHash": "e4a7c8d42afd64bf1120c0678dc42a218526016d521acff05459049194451009"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "複数の条件が満たされた場合は上が優先されます。",
      "sourceHash": "abbd0cffac955c46d10612c1e83314991bf238f41799d19ddfa3b8380305d2bc",
      "translation": "If multiple conditions are met, the one higher on the list takes priority.",
      "contextHash": "abbd0cffac955c46d10612c1e83314991bf238f41799d19ddfa3b8380305d2bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "背景画像（BackgroundImage）",
      "sourceHash": "73b509154aa57a3f6fb38de2e32b51a79e12a9c52dea57f988ec720d8129ff72",
      "translation": "Background Image (BackgroundImage)",
      "contextHash": "73b509154aa57a3f6fb38de2e32b51a79e12a9c52dea57f988ec720d8129ff72"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "メニューに適用する背景画像です。背景リストの指定がなかった場合の既定値となります。",
      "sourceHash": "785f878480fbff72330c4cdc09a9d7b5a19855b4c1ba774311fcbfe695447ed8",
      "translation": "The background image applied to the menu. This is the default value when no background list entry is specified.",
      "contextHash": "785f878480fbff72330c4cdc09a9d7b5a19855b4c1ba774311fcbfe695447ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｘ方向のスクロール（ScrollX）",
      "sourceHash": "04ee7bae66b7876a61ea7578cc0cd74cde251ada856f38c3e70df6f6a4bd6c44",
      "translation": "Scroll in the X Direction (ScrollX)",
      "contextHash": "04ee7bae66b7876a61ea7578cc0cd74cde251ada856f38c3e70df6f6a4bd6c44"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景の横方向へのスクロール速度です。",
      "sourceHash": "7a4b04d3575f461b37fa137d26c07dc0f6720fdbbd12f40b1d0b80bfbadb24cd",
      "translation": "The horizontal scrolling speed of the background.",
      "contextHash": "7a4b04d3575f461b37fa137d26c07dc0f6720fdbbd12f40b1d0b80bfbadb24cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｙ方向のスクロール（ScrollY）",
      "sourceHash": "83b12d8abbd3b091f142657810f32da67a3d48899aafaf08d33fce5d3c9c0bc8",
      "translation": "Scroll in the Y Direction (ScrollY)",
      "contextHash": "83b12d8abbd3b091f142657810f32da67a3d48899aafaf08d33fce5d3c9c0bc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景の縦方向へのスクロール速度です。",
      "sourceHash": "bc191cff8aef7e49011c52a34ee022d1e02867ea237fab44e2e2bbf99a5a7540",
      "translation": "The vertical scrolling speed of the background.",
      "contextHash": "bc191cff8aef7e49011c52a34ee022d1e02867ea237fab44e2e2bbf99a5a7540"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "背景のパラメータ（BackgroundParameters）",
      "sourceHash": "a5fdb25da703f03c27e1a5941330a93ac0051fd33337c30876f4eadf839a2ac9",
      "translation": "Background Parameters (BackgroundParameters)",
      "contextHash": "a5fdb25da703f03c27e1a5941330a93ac0051fd33337c30876f4eadf839a2ac9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "シーン（Scene）",
      "sourceHash": "eb43991ab0eef3b8ef46e7d6775c6d8fea55e38a90e6331b499f2d636f0f4c7f",
      "translation": "Scene (Scene)",
      "contextHash": "eb43991ab0eef3b8ef46e7d6775c6d8fea55e38a90e6331b499f2d636f0f4c7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象とするシーン（コンボ形式）です。",
      "sourceHash": "941498fcfd0012c289c0d792570720e7ad2f188bc7d461a63fe1429117cf1038",
      "translation": "The target scene (combo box format).",
      "contextHash": "941498fcfd0012c289c0d792570720e7ad2f188bc7d461a63fe1429117cf1038"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "既存のシーンを選択する他にも、追加のシーンを手入力できます。",
      "sourceHash": "c74b6c4b91eecf836bbad15bbfd10034579b3af8aec4fd77bd5a8b5b35f547a1",
      "translation": "In addition to selecting an existing scene, you can manually enter an additional scene.",
      "contextHash": "c74b6c4b91eecf836bbad15bbfd10034579b3af8aec4fd77bd5a8b5b35f547a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ALLは全体の設定になります。",
      "sourceHash": "b6978f6da6d4c58e2b43086121b3edcada6670cd6ee5b880c52f67a48ef1b089",
      "translation": "ALL applies the settings globally.",
      "contextHash": "b6978f6da6d4c58e2b43086121b3edcada6670cd6ee5b880c52f67a48ef1b089"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "メモ（Note）",
      "sourceHash": "7d4a70e6b8c7beec1ae6cadcdd1328c4e5bc5f9c853353730c4a72b893becde1",
      "translation": "Note (Note)",
      "contextHash": "7d4a70e6b8c7beec1ae6cadcdd1328c4e5bc5f9c853353730c4a72b893becde1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "説明用のメモです。",
      "sourceHash": "073d1992229d4f68501ca8d01cb81cfd99f03b7c0976c4bc9c0cfaf0a8f01127",
      "translation": "This is a memo for explanation.",
      "contextHash": "073d1992229d4f68501ca8d01cb81cfd99f03b7c0976c4bc9c0cfaf0a8f01127"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ゲーム中には表示されません。",
      "sourceHash": "7ae2d5d83b910ebf900ce529cd11d7cc3a00cf2a1fd6a2272dc7963ffe21e9bb",
      "translation": "It is not displayed in-game.",
      "contextHash": "7ae2d5d83b910ebf900ce529cd11d7cc3a00cf2a1fd6a2272dc7963ffe21e9bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "無効化（Disabled）",
      "sourceHash": "ac95749d7c0b653d81693b1c8424d87dde0a34bb5aac2bd381862521ce35db0e",
      "translation": "Disabled (Disabled)",
      "contextHash": "ac95749d7c0b653d81693b1c8424d87dde0a34bb5aac2bd381862521ce35db0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景の適用をせず無効化します。",
      "sourceHash": "0ed40e2821fb279832285501a33190f14f6c7f51cd29bd55e6f29e941b00492d",
      "translation": "Disables the background without applying it.",
      "contextHash": "0ed40e2821fb279832285501a33190f14f6c7f51cd29bd55e6f29e941b00492d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "共通の背景も無効になります。",
      "sourceHash": "d90be4d71caa4defa825562da54481cb3c48817c0bf088950242cb594470ea80",
      "translation": "The common background is also disabled.",
      "contextHash": "d90be4d71caa4defa825562da54481cb3c48817c0bf088950242cb594470ea80"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "背景画像（BackgroundImage）",
      "sourceHash": "73b509154aa57a3f6fb38de2e32b51a79e12a9c52dea57f988ec720d8129ff72",
      "translation": "Background Image (BackgroundImage)",
      "contextHash": "73b509154aa57a3f6fb38de2e32b51a79e12a9c52dea57f988ec720d8129ff72"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "シーンに適用する背景画像です。",
      "sourceHash": "3b5c3c0cafa714ce9f6cf4238dea37a0634c8a2b3dde2eab16fbb7d7ac92eb64",
      "translation": "The background image to apply to the scene.",
      "contextHash": "3b5c3c0cafa714ce9f6cf4238dea37a0634c8a2b3dde2eab16fbb7d7ac92eb64"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄だと共通の値を使用します。",
      "sourceHash": "6a26618a53d71197ab9e3f1f69c70099ac35bd724cda1a7b18433936ebdf49d1",
      "translation": "If left blank, the common value is used.",
      "contextHash": "6a26618a53d71197ab9e3f1f69c70099ac35bd724cda1a7b18433936ebdf49d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｘ方向のスクロール（ScrollX）",
      "sourceHash": "04ee7bae66b7876a61ea7578cc0cd74cde251ada856f38c3e70df6f6a4bd6c44",
      "translation": "Scroll in the X Direction (ScrollX)",
      "contextHash": "04ee7bae66b7876a61ea7578cc0cd74cde251ada856f38c3e70df6f6a4bd6c44"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-032",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景の横方向へのスクロール速度です。",
      "sourceHash": "7a4b04d3575f461b37fa137d26c07dc0f6720fdbbd12f40b1d0b80bfbadb24cd",
      "translation": "The horizontal scrolling speed of the background.",
      "contextHash": "7a4b04d3575f461b37fa137d26c07dc0f6720fdbbd12f40b1d0b80bfbadb24cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Ｙ方向のスクロール（ScrollY）",
      "sourceHash": "83b12d8abbd3b091f142657810f32da67a3d48899aafaf08d33fce5d3c9c0bc8",
      "translation": "Scroll in the Y Direction (ScrollY)",
      "contextHash": "83b12d8abbd3b091f142657810f32da67a3d48899aafaf08d33fce5d3c9c0bc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-033",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景の縦方向へのスクロール速度です。",
      "sourceHash": "bc191cff8aef7e49011c52a34ee022d1e02867ea237fab44e2e2bbf99a5a7540",
      "translation": "The vertical scrolling speed of the background.",
      "contextHash": "bc191cff8aef7e49011c52a34ee022d1e02867ea237fab44e2e2bbf99a5a7540"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スイッチ（Switch）",
      "sourceHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78",
      "translation": "Switch (Switch)",
      "contextHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-034",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景を有効にするスイッチです。",
      "sourceHash": "f01a1cdb70eeed257d35bb570d393f56e5a4fba4f1dc2cfbebe7a35f1dd5bc83",
      "translation": "The switch that enables the background.",
      "contextHash": "f01a1cdb70eeed257d35bb570d393f56e5a4fba4f1dc2cfbebe7a35f1dd5bc83"
    }
  ],
